# Transactional email standards

Every outbound email must use the **shared Urixoft transactional layout** — the same shell as verify-email and password-reset.

## Required layout

Use helpers from **`$lib/server/mail/templates/transactional-email-layout.ts`**:

| Piece | Helper |
|-------|--------|
| Full HTML document | `buildTransactionalEmailHtml()` |
| Plain-text footer block | `buildTransactionalEmailText()` |
| Body copy | `buildBodyParagraphHtml()` |
| Muted info box | `buildMutedInfoBoxHtml()` |
| Primary CTA button | `buildPrimaryButtonHtml()` |
| Escaping | `escapeHtml()` |

**Do not** hand-roll standalone `<html>` tables or one-off email CSS in senders.

For standard copy + optional CTA/illustration, compose via **`simple-email.ts`** (`buildSimpleEmailHtml` / `buildSimpleEmailText`), which wraps the shared layout.

## Layout must include

1. Hidden **preheader** text
2. **Brand header** — logo + app name + tagline (linked to urixoft.com)
3. White **card** with headline + body
4. Optional **muted info box**, **primary button**, **illustration band** (`/email/*.png`)
5. **Footer** — copyright, Philippines address, urixoft.com / social links

## Assets

- Logo: `${origin}/email/urixoft-logo.png`
- Illustrations: `${origin}/email/<name>.png` (add to `static/email/` when needed)
- Reuse existing illustrations where semantically appropriate

## Sending pattern

```typescript
import { sendMail } from '$lib/server/mail/index';
import { buildSimpleEmailHtml, buildSimpleEmailText } from '$lib/server/mail/templates/simple-email';

await sendMail({
  to,
  subject: '...',
  text: buildSimpleEmailText(content),
  html: buildSimpleEmailHtml(content)
});
```

Custom templates (e.g. verification code layout) may extend `buildTransactionalEmailHtml` directly but must keep the same header, footer, colors, and 76-char HTML line limit for SMTP 7bit.

## Red flags (reject in review)

- New email HTML without `transactional-email-layout.ts`
- Inline-only plain templates missing brand header/footer
- Hardcoded colors outside layout constants
- Missing plain-text alternative (`text` + `html` on every `sendMail`)
